<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 641)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Web shares of optimized QuickTimes are no longer log.</b> When a playlist holds optimized stand-in files themselves, as a bundle does, the web share baked their log picture as if it were video, and web viewers saw log. The bake now decodes such files through their recorded color curve, as the viewer always did. Re-share, or use File &#9656; Update Web Share with Current Grades, to fix a share made before this build.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
