<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 635)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Menus stay put while media optimizes.</b> Optimizing a QuickTime reported progress fast enough to redraw the picture&#8217;s menus under your cursor, so their items flickered and could not be picked. Progress now updates once per percent.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
